('report_finding','To record confirmed vulnerabilities, use evidence Provide verifiable evidence such as command output and logs. Task context is passed to the current intent_id。Returned finding_id is an independent vulnerability record ID，finding_node_id is the exploration node ID（The first line retains the node number）。','{"properties": {"asset_ids": {"description": "\u53d7\u5f71\u54cd\u8d44\u4ea7 id", "items": {"type": "integer"}, "type": "array"}, "evidence": {"description": "\u8bc1\u636e/PoC \u6587\u672c", "type": "string"}, "evidence_hint_id": {"description": "\u53ef\u9009\uff1a\u672c\u4efb\u52a1\u4e2d\u5bf9\u5e94\u6b64\u6f0f\u6d1e\u7684\u63d0\u793a\u8282\u70b9 ID\uff0c\u81ea\u52a8\u643a\u5e26\u5176\u7ed3\u6784\u5316 traffic_refs\uff1b\u4e0d\u80fd\u5f15\u7528\u7ee7\u627f\u63d0\u793a\u6216\u5176\u4ed6\u6f0f\u6d1e\u7684\u63d0\u793a", "type": "integer"}, "intent_id": {"description": "\u5f53\u524d\u4efb\u52a1\u7684\u610f\u56fe id", "type": "integer"}, "name": {"description": "\u6f0f\u6d1e\u540d\u79f0", "type": "string"}, "severity": {"description": "critical|high|medium|low", "type": "string"}, "summary": {"description": "\u53d1\u73b0\u6458\u8981", "type": "string"}, "traffic_refs": {"description": "\u53ef\u9009\uff1bHTTP/HTTPS \u6f0f\u6d1e\u5148\u68c0\u7d22\u5e76\u9010\u6761\u6838\u5b9e\u8bf7\u6c42/\u54cd\u5e94\u786e\u5b9e\u652f\u6301\u6f0f\u6d1e\u7ed3\u8bba\uff0c\u518d\u6309\u590d\u73b0\u987a\u5e8f\u586b\u5199\u771f\u5b9e ID\u3002TCP \u7b49\u975e HTTP \u6f0f\u6d1e\u3001\u672a\u91c7\u96c6\u6216\u627e\u4e0d\u5230\u786e\u5207\u8bb0\u5f55\u65f6\u7701\u7565\u6216\u4f20 []\uff0c\u4e0d\u963b\u6b62\u4e0a\u62a5\uff1b\u53ef\u5728 evidence \u8bf4\u660e\u539f\u56e0\u5e76\u63d0\u4f9b\u5176\u4ed6\u53ef\u9a8c\u8bc1\u8bc1\u636e\u3002\u4e0d\u8981\u731c\u6d4b ID\u3001\u6309\u57df\u540d/\u65f6\u95f4\u63a8\u5b9a\u5173\u8054\u6216\u4ec5\u4e3a\u8865\u5305\u91cd\u590d\u63a2\u6d4b\u3002\u7528\u9014 baseline \u6b63\u5e38\u5bf9\u7167 / proof \u6f0f\u6d1e\u8bc1\u660e / verification \u8865\u5145\u9a8c\u8bc1 / supporting \u8f85\u52a9\u8bc1\u636e\u3002", "items": {"properties": {"note": {"description": "\u8be5\u6d41\u91cf\u5982\u4f55\u652f\u6301\u6f0f\u6d1e\u7ed3\u8bba", "type": "string"}, "role": {"enum": ["baseline", "proof", "verification", "supporting"], "type": "string"}, "traffic_id": {"description": "traffic_search \u8fd4\u56de\u7684\u771f\u5b9e\u6d41\u91cf ID", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["traffic_id"], "type": "object"}, "type": "array"}, "vulnclass": {"description": "\u6f0f\u6d1e\u7c7b\u522b", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["vulnclass", "severity", "summary"], "type": "object"}'::jsonb,'["mainagent", "planner", "worker", "auto", "pentest"]'::jsonb),
('record_fact','Explore【Facts/Conclusion] Write the exploration graph and connect it to the intention that produced it（intent_id）。Used to record exploration results - including fingerprints/Enumeration, etc. [forward conclusion], and''Port closed''/''Parameter cannot be injected''/''Login entry not found''Wait [Negative conclusion】。
⚠️Multiple observations in one exploration should be [summarized into one fact]. Do not split them into multiple observations. If they can be combined into one fact, try to use one fact to express it.：summary=A concluding sentence for this conclusion，detail=Relevant details (can contain multiple specific items). Example: Fingerprint intent→A fact {summary:''Recognized X Site technology stack and response characteristics'', detail:''nginx 1.25 / Vue3 / 200 / title=.. / body_len=..''}，Instead of recording one each for status code, fingerprint, and title. An intention usually only produces one fact. If it is broken down too much, the graph will expand infinitely.。
★facts Array is used to write multiple [different from each other] conclusions at one time (each can be omitted intent_id，Use top level by default intent_id）。Back ids Array, with facts Equal length and same order。
⚠️Only write the conclusion you [actually saw] in the tool output, don’t make up your mind.。evidence and confidence Used to prevent inaccurate conclusions from contaminating the map：
  · evidence=[One line] key evidence supporting this conclusion (command+The one or two lines of output that best prove），**Be concise**——Details are in detail，Don’t paste large sections of output here。
  · confidence=observed（See it directly in the output）| inferred（Inference based on phenomena）。
  · **Negative conclusion**（Not injectable/Port closed/No entry found etc.) write only"Observation + Tentative reading"——State what you actually see. Whether the direction should be given up is determined by the planner based on the overall situation; be sure to give evidence，The means are endless or the evidence is weak (including only one exploration, it looks like) inferred，It has been exhausted and the talent mark can be seen directly observed。','{"properties": {"asset_ids": {"description": "\u76f8\u5173\u8d44\u4ea7 id\uff08\u53ef\u9009\uff0c0/1/\u591a\u4e2a\uff09\uff1a\u8be5\u4e8b\u5b9e\u6d89\u53ca\u54ea\u4e9b\u8d44\u4ea7", "items": {"type": "integer"}, "type": "array"}, "confidence": {"description": "observed\uff08\u8f93\u51fa\u91cc\u76f4\u63a5\u770b\u5230\uff09| inferred\uff08\u636e\u73b0\u8c61\u63a8\u65ad\uff09\u3002\u5426\u5b9a\u7ed3\u8bba\u52a1\u5fc5\u5982\u5b9e\u6807\u6ce8\u3002", "type": "string"}, "detail": {"description": "\u672c\u4e8b\u5b9e\u7684\u76f8\u5173\u7ec6\u8282\uff1a\u628a\u8fd9\u6b21\u63a2\u7d22\u7684\u591a\u4e2a\u89c2\u5bdf\u4e8b\u5b9e\u90fd\u5199\u8fdb\u8fd9\u91cc", "type": "string"}, "evidence": {"description": "\u3010\u4e00\u884c\u3011\u5173\u952e\u8bc1\u636e\uff1a\u547d\u4ee4 + \u6700\u80fd\u8bc1\u660e\u7ed3\u8bba\u7684\u90a3\u4e00\u4e24\u884c\u8f93\u51fa\u3002\u52a1\u5fc5\u7b80\u6d01\uff0c\u4e0d\u8981\u7c98\u5927\u6bb5\u8f93\u51fa\uff08\u7ec6\u8282\u653e detail\uff09\u3002", "type": "string"}, "facts": {"description": "\u3010\u6709\u591a\u6761\u4e0d\u540c\u7ed3\u8bba\u65f6\u7528\u3011\u4e8b\u5b9e\u6570\u7ec4\uff0c\u5143\u7d20\u5b57\u6bb5\u540c\u4e0b\u65b9\u9876\u5c42\u5b57\u6bb5\uff08summary/detail/evidence/confidence/intent_id/asset_ids\uff09\uff1b\u7701\u7565 intent_id \u5219\u7528\u9876\u5c42 intent_id\u3002\u8fd4\u56de ids \u4e0e\u672c\u6570\u7ec4\u7b49\u957f\u3001\u540c\u5e8f\u3002", "items": {"type": "object"}, "type": "array"}, "intent_id": {"description": "\u4ea7\u751f\u672c\u4e8b\u5b9e\u7684\u610f\u56fe id\uff08\u4f60\u9886\u5230\u7684\u610f\u56fe\uff1b\u6279\u91cf\u65f6\u4f5c\u4e3a\u5404\u6761\u9ed8\u8ba4\uff09", "type": "integer"}, "summary": {"description": "\u5bf9\u672c\u6b21\u63a2\u7d22\u7ed3\u8bba\u7684\u3010\u603b\u7ed3\u6027\u4e00\u53e5\u8bdd\u3011\uff08\u662f\u5bf9 detail \u7684\u6982\u62ec\uff09", "type": "string"}}, "type": "object"}'::jsonb,'["mainagent", "worker"]'::jsonb),
