('goal_met','【End the entire mission immediately] - Only adjust when you confirm that [all goals of the mission have been truly achieved and the overall ending] (note that the mission [whole] is completed; only one of the goals is achieved/a certain one flag/A certain vulnerability [does not count] - use it in that case prove_goal Just mark the target）。⚠️It is not used to ”end this round of planning”: there are no new intentions to send or wait for this round. worker Output, just end this round directly, do not adjust this tool】（0 intentions are completely normal). Normal judgment is given priority. prove_goal Prove goals one by one；goal_met It’s just a way to bypass the proofs one by one and end directly from the overall situation.。','{"properties": {"reason": {"description": "\u8fbe\u6210\u7406\u7531\uff08\u5fc5\u987b\u662f\u76ee\u6807\u771f\u6b63\u8fbe\u6210\u7684\u8bc1\u636e\uff0c\u4e0d\u80fd\u662f\u201c\u672c\u8f6e\u65e0\u65b0\u65b9\u5411\u201d\u8fd9\u7c7b\u7ed3\u675f\u672c\u8f6e\u7684\u7406\u7531\uff09", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["reason"], "type": "object"}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb),
('kill_work','Terminate a running intent(work)。Used to stop deviation/Pointless exploration; terminated intent marked as stopped，No longer automatically reclaimed. Use first get_worker_output See what it is doing before deciding。','{"properties": {"intent_id": {"description": "\u8981\u7ec8\u6b62\u7684\u610f\u56fe id\uff08= work \u53e5\u67c4\uff09", "type": "integer"}}, "required": ["intent_id"], "type": "object"}'::jsonb,'["planner"]'::jsonb),
('list_companies','List [Enterprises in the asset library/Company] and its asset scope(scope)and the number of vested assets. Used to check which companies are available and get company_id（insert_assets Association app、list_assets Press company_id used for filtration). Optional search Fuzzy filter by company name(Not case sensitive)，Leave blank to return to all。','{"properties": {"search": {"description": "\u6309\u516c\u53f8\u540d\u6a21\u7cca\u8fc7\u6ee4(\u53ef\u9009\uff0c\u4e0d\u533a\u5206\u5927\u5c0f\u5199)\uff1b\u7559\u7a7a\u8fd4\u56de\u5168\u90e8", "type": "string"}}, "type": "object"}'::jsonb,'["planner", "auto", "pentest"]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO tools(key,description,schema,agents,system,kind)
SELECT key,description,schema,agents,TRUE,'builtin' FROM tool_defaults ON CONFLICT(key) DO NOTHING;
-- Correct the demonstrably wrong initial insert_assets seed, preserving user edits.
UPDATE tools t SET description=d.description,schema=d.schema,agents=d.agents FROM tool_defaults d
WHERE t.key=d.key AND t.key='insert_assets' AND t.description='Asset storage (go F18 Gate）' AND t.agents='["worker"]'::jsonb;
